    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say they care but it just feels like they're just being nice because they feel bad for me. it's exhausting pretending to be okay when it isn't. sometimes i just wonder if there's actually any point to all this struggle if it's just gonna be the same cycle forever.",
